{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15550","headline":"小苑春望宫池柳色 · 元友直","name":"小苑春望宫池柳色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳色新池遍，春光御苑晴。\n叶依青阁密，条向碧流倾。\n路暗阴初重，波摇影转清。\n风从垂处度，烟就望中生。\n断续游蜂聚，飘颻戏蝶轻。\n怡然变芳节，愿及一枝荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元友直","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}